==Trivia==
*During the initial planning phase, this zone was called '''Frostwind Desert'''. Concept art depicts a land of rocky outcroppings and purple sands, and artist [[Ely Cannon]] has noted that there was "a heavy purple fog" in the area.<ref>{{ref web |url=https://elycannon.artstation.com/projects/V2b93g?album_id=14195083 |title=Ely Cannon on ArtStation |quote=The zone had a heavy purple fog in its early days and as such the concepts were painted against a similar colored background for evaluation purposes.}}</ref> However, the purple sand in the concept art was frequently mistaken for snow,{{fact}} eventually resulting in the desert idea being abandoned in favor of a frozen wasteland with volcanic activity. A fragment of this concept appears to exist in the final version, though, as Cordana mentions "scouting the dunes" to the Horde commander.
**The [[Frostwind Crag|Frostwind Dunes]] are a zone mentioned in the ''[[Warcraft (film)|Warcraft]]'' movie.
